<v Cecilia Brown>发生了什么？

00:35:22.020 --> 00:35:34.100
<v Dee Brown>Oh, I tried to swallow things and look at things, and I don't know what I'm doing. Because everything's in the dark.
<v Dee Brown>哦，我试着吞东西，看着东西，但我不知道我在做什么。因为一切都在黑暗中。

