<v Dee Brown>Yeah, and so what is it that you're trying to do?
<v Dee Brown>是啊，那你正在试图做什么？

00:39:14.840 --> 00:39:18.470
<v Cecilia Brown>Oh, it's Cecilia, your granddaughter. I'm calling to say hi.
